      "key": "decision.why_not",
      "text": "{arm:1017} drops pass rate by {reading.1017.change|abs|pts} points and increases cost by {cost.uplift.1017|usd}. {arm:qwen3.8-flash} drops pass rate by {reading.qwen3.8-flash.change|abs|pts} points and costs {cost.uplift.qwen3.8-flash|usd} more."
